# Claude Code (claude)
# skills: ~/.claude/skills

## mcp-config, server waits up to 50s
# Claude Code: add agora for every project (user scope).
claude mcp add --transport http --scope user agora 'http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp?namespace=default'

# Or, for one project only, put this in .mcp.json at its root:
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "agora": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp?namespace=default"
    }
  }
}

## mcp-config, server waits up to 4m0s
# Claude Code: add agora for every project (user scope).
claude mcp add --transport http --scope user agora 'http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp?namespace=default'
# The server's waits outlast Claude Code's 60s limit on an HTTP tool call.
# Add "timeout": 250000 to the agora entry that command writes to
# ~/.claude.json, or start Claude Code with MCP_TOOL_TIMEOUT=250000.

# Or, for one project only, put this in .mcp.json at its root:
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "agora": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp?namespace=default",
      "timeout": 250000
    }
  }
}

## stop hook
# Claude Code Stop hook: merge into "hooks" in ~/.claude/settings.json.
# It keeps a session from ending while it is expected in an agora
# conversation, and does nothing unless AGORA_AGENT is set in the session's
# environment (with AGORA_URL and AGORA_NAMESPACE if not the defaults).
{
  "hooks": {
    "Stop": [
      { "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "agora hook stop" } ] }
    ]
  }
}
